  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.34 “Notice of tax date” means \"date of notice of tax\" as defined in RSA 76:1-a, II and III for property tax appeals and LUCT appeals respectively, and as defined in RSA 72:1-d, II for exemption appeals.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.30); ss by 8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.34); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.36); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
